msgid "Step 5: Review"
msgstr "Étape 5 : Révision"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:299
msgid "Review the complete Virtual Switch configuration before applying."
msgstr "Vérifiez la configuration complète du commutateur virtuel avant de l'appliquer."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:301
msgid "Review step showing complete configuration summary"
msgstr "Étape de révision affichant le résumé complet de la configuration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:301
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"/images/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches/vs_review.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"/images/infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches/vs_review.png"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:304
msgid "The review displays:"
msgstr "La révision affiche :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:306
msgid "**Name** — Virtual Switch name"
msgstr "**Nom** — Nom du commutateur virtuel"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:307
msgid "**Traffic Types** — Selected traffic types"
msgstr "**Types de trafic** — Types de trafic sélectionnés"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:308
msgid "**Bond Mode** — Bond configuration"
msgstr "**Mode de bond** — Configuration du bond"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:309
msgid "**Uplink NICs** — Per-host NIC assignments"
msgstr "**Cartes réseau uplink** — Assignations de cartes réseau par Hôte"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:311
msgid ""
"Click **Finish** to create the Virtual Switch. The configuration is "
"applied to all hosts in the cluster."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur **Finish** pour créer le commutateur virtuel. La configuration est "
"appliquée à tous les Hôtes du Cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:314
msgid "Editing a Virtual Switch"
msgstr "Modification d'un commutateur virtuel"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:316
msgid ""
"Click the edit icon (pencil) next to a Virtual Switch to modify its "
"configuration. You can change:"
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur l'icône de modification (crayon) à côté d'un commutateur virtuel pour modifier sa "
"configuration. Vous pouvez changer :"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:318
msgid "Uplink NICs (add/remove interfaces)"
msgstr "Cartes réseau uplink (ajouter/supprimer des interfaces)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:319
msgid "Bond mode"
msgstr "Mode de bond"

